5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. I believe we should look closely at the history of our successes to guide us.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree we need a rational approach. I am particularly concerned with the actual human resources available to execute these projects.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I think it is vital to consider the infrastructure. If the shared services are overwhelmed, the research will suffer regardless of the proposal's quality.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A most prudent start. I find myself wondering about the actual purchasing power of our grants these days. It would be enlightening to see the ledgers.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I hope we can find a balanced choice. I am worried about non-scientific delays, so I want to see where work usually stops.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Benjamin, that is a very practical point. I wonder if we should also check how the data is being handled in the repositories.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Victoria, infrastructure is one thing, but the people operating it are another. I will be looking into the staffing rolls.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, those two are linked. I will look into the facility bookings and the incident logs to see the current pressure on our shared assets.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shizue, your point on repositories is noted. However, I shall focus on the financial specifics to see what the agency still covers centrally.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Victoria, that sounds like a good plan. I think I will look into the incident logs as well, and perhaps the portfolio review for overruns.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I feel we are all being very thorough. I shall look into the closeout files and the repository turnaround to see what truly gets finished.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also examine the minutes on secondments. It is essential to know if the listed staff are actually present or just on paper.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,pass,Victoria,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall pair the ledgers with the national computing agreement. It should clarify the current day rates and who pays for them.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
